  "abstract": "This is a restatement of signal invariance. It adds nothing to reinforcement learning from veri\ufb01able rewards. It does not show that a pool resolution is style-independent. It does not show that a \ufb01tted reward model inherits the invariance of . It also says nothing about how a trained policy allocates gradient effort. Any policy-level claim would require a stated separability model and empirical training evidence. Neither is present here.",
